# Response headers for every path served by the Worker's static assets.
#
# THESE LIVE HERE AND NOT IN THE DASHBOARD: a file in the tree can be diffed,
# guarded (section 104) and shipped in a release; a dashboard rule can be none
# of those — and Transform Rules WIN over these, so the wire is read after
# every deploy (RELEASING.md, "The wire checks"). HSTS and
# X-Content-Type-Options are set at the edge and deliberately not duplicated.
# Content-Security-Policy stays in index.html's <meta>: the guards bless its
# hash against the one inline script.
#
# The two responses worker.js constructs restate the /* set themselves;
# guard 133 holds them equal to this file.
#
# Cache policy: sw.js and / are no-cache (revalidate before use — sw.js is how
# a returning browser learns the app changed, and a non-SW visitor must
# revalidate the document or a bad deploy is sticky). The fonts are
# content-addressed by qa/font-subset.json and take a year, immutable. The
# icons, the manifest and the share card take a day: a year is only honest
# behind a hashed filename, and an unstable favicon is a listed Google cause
# of non-appearance. The agent-facing files and security.txt are no-cache:
# an agent asks once and writes the answer down.
#
# The Link: lines sit under /, not /*: a canonical relation is a statement
# about a document, and _headers matches on path only, cumulatively, with no
# way to unset. describedby points at /llms.txt, the same file the Worker
# serves to a client whose Accept prefers text/markdown; Vary: Accept on /
# says so to any shared cache. Permissions-Policy denies what the app never
# uses; interest-cohort is not listed and section 104 refuses it by name.
#
# The history of every decision above is in NOTES-history.md
# ("Where the served and config files' histories went").

/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

/
  Link: <https://nightwatcher.life/sitemap.xml>; rel="sitemap"
  Link: <https://nightwatcher.life/>; rel="canonical"
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Vary: Accept

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/auth.md
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/llms.txt
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/orders.txt
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/.well-known/security.txt
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/icon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/favicon-16x16.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/favicon-32x32.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/favicon-48x48.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/apple-touch-icon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/mstile-144x144.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/icon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/icon-192.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/icon-maskable-512.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/share.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
